item.tconstruct.arrow.desc=The Arrows are the ammo used for Tinkers' Bows. One stack provides many shots, and they can be modified as any tool.
item.tconstruct.battleaxe.desc=The Battleaxe is a heavy offensive weapon, bringing the berserker out. It is capable of bringing down small trees and can send foes flying.\nRight Click: Berserk
item.tconstruct.battlesign.desc=The Battlesign is the ultimate defensive weapon. An advance in weapon technology worthy of Zombie Pigmen everywhere.\nCan be used as a shield, reflects projectiles.
item.tconstruct.bolt.desc=The Bolts are the ammo used for Tinkers' Crossbows. One stack provides many shots, and they can be modified as any tool.\nPartially penetrates enemy armor.
item.tconstruct.book.tooltip=The book every Tinker needs\nby Skyla
item.tconstruct.broadsword.desc=The Broadsword is a universal weapon. Sweep attacks keep enemy hordes at bay.\nAlso good against cobwebs!
item.tconstruct.cleaver.desc=The Cleaver is a heavy offensive weapon. It has powerful strikes, but is difficult to wield.\nCleavers benefit from high damage.\nSlow, requires two hands!
item.tconstruct.crossbow.desc=The Crossbow is a slow but very powerful weapon. It has to be loaded beforehand by holding rightclick, but can be fired at any moment afterwards.\nUses Tinkers' Bolts.
item.tconstruct.excavator.desc=The Excavator is a broad digging tool. It digs up large areas of soil and snow in a wide range.\nTerraforming!
item.tconstruct.frypan.desc=The Frying Pan is a heavy weapon with knockback to create some distance. It also goes BOING!\nRight Click: Heavy Blow
item.tconstruct.hammer.desc=The Hammer is a broad mining tool. It harvests blocks in a wide range.\nAlso effective against undead.
item.tconstruct.hatchet.desc=The Hatchet chops up wood and makes short work of leaves. It also makes for a passable weapon.\nChop chop!
item.tconstruct.ingots.knightslime.tooltip=Slimy yet metallic but also stone? Fascinating!
item.tconstruct.ingots.pigiron.tooltip=Oink!
item.tconstruct.kama.desc=The Kama is a precision reaping tool, mowing down plants and shearing animals.\nRight Click: Harvest and replant crops
item.tconstruct.longbow.desc=The Longbow is a powerful long range weapon. It provides high damage but is less mobile than its short brother.\nUses Tinkers' Arrows.
item.tconstruct.longsword.desc=The Longsword is an offensive weapon. It is often used for charging into battle at full speed.\nRight Click: Lunge
item.tconstruct.lumberaxe.desc=The Lumber Axe is a broad chopping tool. It can fell entire trees in one swoop or gather wood in a wide range.\nTimber!
item.tconstruct.materials.creative_modifier.tooltip=Adds an additional modifier
item.tconstruct.materials.expander_h.tooltip=Do you even lift?
item.tconstruct.materials.expander_w.tooltip=Don't skip leg day!
item.tconstruct.materials.mending_moss.tooltip=Mending Moss Modifier
item.tconstruct.materials.moss.tooltip=Right click a Bookshelf with this\nto convert it into Mending Moss.\n§oConsumes 10 Levels
item.tconstruct.materials.mud_brick.tooltip=Building blocks for small and big
item.tconstruct.materials.necrotic_bone.tooltip=Necrotic Modifier
item.tconstruct.materials.reinforcement.tooltip=Reinforced Modifier
item.tconstruct.materials.silky_jewel.tooltip=Silktouch Modifier
item.tconstruct.materials.slimecrystal_blue.tooltip=item.tconstruct.materials.slimecrystal_green.tooltip
item.tconstruct.materials.slimecrystal_green.tooltip=Used to craft Slime Tools
item.tconstruct.materials.slimecrystal_magma.tooltip=item.tconstruct.materials.slimecrystal_green.tooltip
item.tconstruct.mattock.desc=The Cutter Mattock is a versatile farming tool. It is effective on wood, dirt, and plants. It also packs quite a punch.\nRight Click: Hoe ground
item.tconstruct.moms_spaghetti.desc=Delicious!
item.tconstruct.pickaxe.desc=The Pickaxe is a precise mining tool. It is effective on stone and ores.\nIt breaks blocks, OK?
item.tconstruct.piggybackpack.tooltip=Right-click mobs to pick them up
item.tconstruct.rapier.desc=The Rapier is a special weapon that relies on quick strikes to defeat foes.\nRight Click: Backpedal
item.tconstruct.scythe.desc=The Scythe is a broad reaping tool, mowing down plants and foes alike.\nHas an AOE Attack.\nRight Click: Harvest and replant crops
item.tconstruct.sharpening_kit.tooltip=Combine with a flint\nUpgrades your tool to the material's mining level.
item.tconstruct.shortbow.desc=The Shortbow is a quick and nimble weapon. It allows for fast movements while shooting arrows at a rapid rate.\nUses Tinkers' Arrows.
item.tconstruct.shovel.desc=The Shovel digs up dirt. It is effective on dirt, sand, gravel and snow.\nJust don't dig your own grave!
item.tconstruct.shuriken.desc=The Shuriken is a fast, short ranged throwing weapon. It has high quantities but low damage.\nCan be thrown from the off-hand.
item.tconstruct.slime_boots.tooltip=Makes you bounce when landing
item.tconstruct.slimesling.tooltip=Charge up, aim low, get flinging!\nUse Slime Boots if you value your life!
item.tconstruct.spaghetti.cold.tooltip=Well, that's better, but they still taste gross.\nWarming them up should make them edible.\nThey might even be good enough to get you off your weak knees.
item.tconstruct.spaghetti.hard.tooltip=Completely inedible like that.\nThey need to be softened up, even your sweaty palms aren't enough for that.\nThey should probably soak in some water for a while.
item.tconstruct.spaghetti.soggy.tooltip=Now they're all wet, even your spaghetti arms can bend them now.\nLet's hang them up and get them dry.
item.tconstruct.throwball.efln.tooltip=Explodes! Safe for mining
item.tconstruct.throwball.glow.tooltip=Not suited for consumption.
item.tconstruct.wooden_hopper.tooltip=Slower, cheaper variant of the hopper
